    "text": "Hi everyone!\nI’ve noticed that several complex type (`jsonb`, `text[]`) are replicated by olake as `string`- is there anything to be done about that? i.e. have `jsonb` replicated as `variant` and `text[]` replicated as `list\u0026lt;string\u0026gt;`?",
